    "description": "Monster House is a Discovery Channel television program that documented the themed remodeling of a residence in a five-day time frame. In 2004, the episode \"Zen House\" was nominated for a Primetime Emmy Award for Outstanding Main Title Theme Music for its opening song by composer Dan Mackenzie.\n\nIn early 2006, Discovery Channel announced the show had been canceled and the final episode, titled \"Farewell House\", aired in February.\n\nMonster House is now running in reruns in 2012 on Spike TV.",
